mb|P|mb|1C|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Some might open 1N. But because I have a reasonable rebid of 1@S, I prefer to open 1@C. Although many would open 1N with my hand, I prefer to not have 2 doubletons when I open 1N.|
PG| ***** 2 ***** |


mb|1S|mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|P|mb|2C|mb|2S|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|2@S is correct. In fact, 3@S would not be terrible even if partner has nothing, West will take 7 tricks. And as you can see, they are making 4@S. I am not saying it should be bid, but partner didn't need much.|
