UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I might bid 3@S over 2@C with the West hand. But even if West does so, with a spade void, despite the 8 HCP, I would not bid 4@S or 3N with the East hand. So it is very difficult to get to 4@S.|
PG| ***** 17 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|However, it is also not completely inconceivable for West to bid 4@S over 1@C. And I might very well do that, particularly at this vulnerability.|
PG| ***** 18 ***** |


