https://tinyurl.com/258v3ymu
qx|A2|st||rh||ah|Board 2 IMPs   -   July 17, 2024|pn|hondo717,IraCT,danpsych,Sputniks|
md|1SKJ7643HKQ97DT7C6,S92HA85DK98652C53,SAQT85H32DQJ3CAJ7,SHJT64DA4CKQT9842|sv|e|
mb|2S|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|There are some players who will not open a weak-2 with an outside 4 card major. The theory being that you might miss a major suit fit if you do, though, I completely disagree with that. You should strain to preempt as that is a very effective tactic. |
PG| ***** 20 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|And the odds that it is better to play in your 4 card suit than your 6 card suit are very small. At worst it is a push even with a 4-4 fit. So I strongly recommend you open a weak-2 whether or not you have an outside 4 card major if your hand is appropriate otherwise.|
PG| ***** 21 ***** |


