UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I was very unlucky here. DONT could have worked out well on this hand also if our hands were reversed. DONT works out well quite often, just happened to not work out here, though, it is still a great convention and you should strain to use it with an appropriate hand when an opponent opens 1N.|
